<title>USA: Brunswick closes Life Fitness purchase.</title>
<headline>Brunswick closes Life Fitness purchase.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE FOREST, Ill. 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brunswick Corp said it completed a previously announced $310 million acquisition of Life Fitness from a private equity fund managed by Mancuso &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Life Fitness designs, markets and makes computerized cardiovascular and strength training fitness equipment for health clubs, military, government, corporate and university facilities and consumer markets.</p>
<p>Brunswick makes and markets fishing and camping equipment, bicycles and bowling equipment and pleasure boats and outboard engines.</p>
<p>			 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
